                            Rexx/SQL
                            for ODBC
                         eCS & OS/2 3.0+


This archive contains the executables for Rexx/SQL for Visigenic's
ODBC drivers;  both .exe and .dll's.

Rexx/SQL is distributed under the terms of the GNU Library General Public
License. See the enclosed file COPYING-LIB for details.

Rexx/SQL supports either the "classic" OS/2 Rexx or Object Rexx.

Some test scripts are included.  See INSTALL for testing you Rexx/SQL
installation.

Source code for Rexx/SQL for OS/2 and other operating systems and
source and executables for other database packages are available from
    http://rexxsql.sf.net/

Online HTML, documentation is available from
    http://rexxsql.sf.net/doc/

If you find problems with or suggestions for this product, please contact me.
